# MCP Awareness

If MCP tools are available, prefer them when they match the task better than built-in tools.

- Check `GetMcpTools` before assuming a server exists
- Authenticate via `mcp_auth` only when a call fails with auth error
- If no MCP servers configured, ignore this rule
